MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: e9620f8c34305754d8cc9a7e49e852d9, type: 3}
  m_Name: DialogueText_en
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Unity.Localization::UnityEngine.Localization.Tables.StringTable
  m_LocaleId:
    m_Code: en
  m_SharedData: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f8fabd72a30bffb479f5f15b97ffd357, type: 2}
  m_Metadata:
    m_Items: []
  m_TableData:
  - m_Id: 2674851028992
    m_Localized: "Hello, I\u2019m called the Glow.\nI\u2019m desperately searching
      for the Celestial Drum, but I can\u2019t see it anywhere\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2674947497984
    m_Localized: Would you like me to help you find it?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2674947497985
    m_Localized: Perfect!!! Thank you so much! I can guide you through this world.
      Together, we can achieve great things.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2674947497986
    m_Localized: '

      the Celestial Drum is located in a pointy stele.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2674951692288
    m_Localized: 'You just remembered the melody that alows you to generate platforms.
      Try to use it to pass over these thorns ! '
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2674951692289
    m_Localized: Play the melodie 2 times to generate the platform. Try to get passed
      these thorns now !
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2674951692290
    m_Localized: "\"Wait! It\u2019s\u2026 !!!\""
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2674951692291
    m_Localized: "\"A faded zone\u2026 The Monochronite has spread again! It has
      taken over this place.\""
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2674951692292
    m_Localized: "This disease turns all matter fade and monochrome. It spreads so
      fast\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2674951692293
    m_Localized: "Originally, faded zones were only in the central hub, but now,
      they\u2019ve started spreading outside it too."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2674951692294
    m_Localized: I need to heal the World Tree to free the central hub.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2674951692295
    m_Localized: The Cosmic Tree?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2674951692296
    m_Localized: "This tree is the world-tree you\u2019re currently walking on. Its
      sap, the sap of hope, nourishes the plants of this reality!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2674951692297
    m_Localized: 'You yourself were summoned by the world tree ! '
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2674951692298
    m_Localized: But faded zones can still be healed, especially this one, if all
      the lanterns in it are lit.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2674951692299
    m_Localized: Remember ! Monochronite remains a formidable enemy. But together,
      we can defeat it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2674951692300
    m_Localized: You just have to take me close to them.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2674951692301
    m_Localized: You just remembered the melody to perform the Push Spell.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2674951692302
    m_Localized: Look the path goes up this slope but It seems too steep for you
      to climb.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2674951692303
    m_Localized: 'Surely, you have what it takes to go up there anyway ! '
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2674955886592
    m_Localized: try to use it when you see objects glow green.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2674955886593
    m_Localized: 'Thanks for Playing ! More coming soon ! '
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2674955886594
    m_Localized: "You\u2019ve retrieved the Celestial Drum! It grants powers by playing
      melodies made from its three notes."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2674955886595
    m_Localized: Each of its buttons corresponds to a note. Associate them to activate
      powers.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2674955886596
    m_Localized: Find the other steles to remember. Pay attention to the notes buttons
      when you interact with them and try to replicate the melodies they show you
      !
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2674985246720
    m_Localized: Voulez vous prendre le cube
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2674985246721
    m_Localized: oui
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2674985246722
    m_Localized: non
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2674985246723
    m_Localized: 'Hello je suis la capsule , j''ai une quete pour toi.dqsdsqqsdqsd

      qsdqsdsqdqsdqsdsqdqsdsdsqdqsdqsdqsdqsdqsdsqdqsdqsd

      qsdqsdqsdqsdsqdqdqsdqsdqsdqsdqsdsqqsdqsdqsd'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2674985246724
    m_Localized: Ramene moi un cube
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2674985246725
    m_Localized: yes
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2674985246726
    m_Localized: no
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2674985246727
    m_Localized: Ok
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2674985246728
    m_Localized: A tu ramener mon cube
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2674985246729
    m_Localized: Oui
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2674985246730
    m_Localized: Non
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2674985246731
    m_Localized: RAMENE MON CUBE!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2674985246732
    m_Localized: Merci
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
