  - m_Id: 7662735655100416
    m_Localized: 'Salut je suis benoit '
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7662735697043456
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7664854604898304
    m_Localized: 1
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7664854571343872
    m_Localized: Choisi 1 ou 2 ou 3
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7664854604898305
    m_Localized: 2
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7664922703618048
    m_Localized: 3
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7674215982145536
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7674216066031616
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7674387986358272
    m_Localized: Yes
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7674387982163968
    m_Localized: Hey You ther could you pick that cube and bring it to me ??
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7674387986358273
    m_Localized: NO
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7674626029887488
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7674743566868480
    m_Localized: OK
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7674743566868481
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7674919694082048
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7674919694082049
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7675007506030592
    m_Localized: BRING ME MY CUBE!!!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7675007506030593
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7675092155473920
    m_Localized: Merci
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7675092155473921
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7675269461286912
    m_Localized: A tu ramener mon cube
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7675269469675520
    m_Localized: Yes
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7675269469675521
    m_Localized: No
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7677177844441088
    m_Localized: Do you want to take the cubeBenoit
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7677177924132864
    m_Localized: Oui
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7677177924132865
    m_Localized: NON
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7677413950201856
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7716713366528001
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7716713366528000
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7716713366528002
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14194241760055297
    m_Localized: What do you think, George?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19950094593216530
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14194241760055300
    m_Localized: And a river, George?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19950094593216529
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19950094593216528
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19950094593216527
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19950094593216526
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19950094593216525
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19950094593216524
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19950094593216523
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14194241764249603
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19950094593216522
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 20778256340275200
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14194241764249606
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19950094593216520
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19950094593216519
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14194241764249609
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19950094593216518
    m_Localized: See where the platforms lead? Maybe we could go over the brambles.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19950094593216517
    m_Localized: "Looks like it\u2026 What if you played the same rhythm again?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19950094593216516
    m_Localized: Oh! Did the drum do that?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19950094593216515
    m_Localized: "Top (3)\u2026 Middle (2)\u2026 Bottom (1). Try that order."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19950094593216514
    m_Localized: "Nothing has moved yet\u2026 Look at the marks from top to bottom."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19950094593216513
    m_Localized: What if you tried playing them in that order? Take your time. Look
      carefully and listen.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19950094593216512
    m_Localized: "These marks\u2026 They look like the notes on my drum."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19950094593216534
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19950198226079744
    m_Localized: "Wait\u2026 See how the colours have changed here?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19950198226079745
    m_Localized: What happened?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19950198226079746
    m_Localized: "More and more parts of the World Tree are turning dull. The inhabitants
      call it the Monochronite. We don\u2019t understand everything that\u2019s going
      on yet."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19950198226079747
    m_Localized: Can the colours come back?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19950198226079748
    m_Localized: "Let\u2019s try. See that lantern? Bring me close to it. Maybe I
      can pass on a little of my light."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19950198226079749
    m_Localized: It works!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19950198226079750
    m_Localized: Have you spotted the other lanterns?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19950198226079751
    m_Localized: "Funny\u2026 the same place looks completely different."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19950198226079752
    m_Localized: "Yes\u2026 It reminds me of the times when we feel lonely or worried.
      Everything can seem duller too. A bit of support can help us see things differently."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19950198226079753
    m_Localized: Shall we keep going?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19950198226079754
    m_Localized: "Let\u2019s go."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19950198226079755
    m_Localized: "Looks like something\u2019s going on over there."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19950198226079756
    m_Localized: "Let\u2019s get closer. Let\u2019s hear what they\u2019re saying."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19950198226079757
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19950198226079758
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19950198226079759
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19950198226079760
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19950198226079761
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19950198226079762
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19950198226079763
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19950198226079764
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19950198226079765
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19950198226079766
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19950198226079767
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19950198226079768
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19950198226079769
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19950198226079770
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19950198226079771
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19950198226079772
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19950198226079773
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19950198226079774
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19950198226079775
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19950570999042048
    m_Localized: "We\u2019ll need to figure out how to get across. Want to take a
      breather? There\u2019s a bench right there."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19950570999042049
    m_Localized: From here, what do you notice?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19950570999042050
    m_Localized: "Let\u2019s go and look at them when you\u2019re ready."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19950570999042051
    m_Localized: We can start by looking around. No need to find the whole way at
      once.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19950570999042052
    m_Localized: We can take a moment to look before moving on. What would you prefer?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19950570999042053
    m_Localized: "Okay, let\u2019s explore!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19950570999042054
    m_Localized: Yes, a short break would do me good.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19950570999042055
    m_Localized: "But\u2026 shouldn\u2019t we keep moving?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19950570999042056
    m_Localized: I feel great. I want to keep going!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19950570999042057
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19950570999042058
    m_Localized: "The steles\u2026 I\u2019d like to take a closer look."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19950570999042059
    m_Localized: "I can\u2019t see how to get across yet."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19950570999042060
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19950570999042061
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19950570999042062
    m_Localized: "Let\u2019s sit for a moment."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19950570999042063
    m_Localized: "Let\u2019s keep exploring."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19950570999042064
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19950661797335040
    m_Localized: "Whoa, that\u2019s steep! Look around you\u2026 Can you see somewhere
      to get a foothold and climb to the top?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19950661797335041
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19950724871278592
    m_Localized: "See those mushrooms? They\u2019re called chrono shrooms. They react
      when you touch them. Want to try activating one?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19950724871278593
    m_Localized: "Go up to one of them. You\u2019ll see what happens!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19950724871278594
    m_Localized: "It doesn\u2019t stay on for long\u2026 Can you reach the other
      two in time?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19950724871278595
    m_Localized: "They\u2019ve gone out\u2026 Want to plan your route before trying
      again?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19950724871278596
    m_Localized: Look where they are. Which one would make the shortest route to
      start with?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19950724871278597
    m_Localized: Take your time. You can take a breather and come back whenever you
      like.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19950724871278598
    m_Localized: Got it!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19950724871278599
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19950724871278600
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19950724871278601
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19950724871278602
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19950724871278603
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19950724871278604
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19950724871278605
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19950724871278606
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19950724871278607
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19950724871278608
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19950724871278609
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19950724871278610
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19950724871278611
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19950724871278612
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19950724871278613
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19950724871278614
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19950724871278615
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19950724871278616
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19950724871278617
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19950775983067136
    m_Localized: What are these pedestals for?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19950775983067137
    m_Localized: "I\u2019ve seen travellers leave fruit on them before. I always
      wondered why\u2026 There are two pedestals. Want to try putting a fruit on
      each?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19950775983067138
    m_Localized: Did you see any fruit on the way? Look over by the trees.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19950775983067139
    m_Localized: What if you put it on one of the pedestals?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19950775983067140
    m_Localized: "There\u2019s still an empty one\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19950775983067141
    m_Localized: "So that\u2019s how you open the path!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19950775983067142
    m_Localized: "Now you know how to do it. It\u2019s lovely when you think about
      it\u2026 Someone learned these gestures, passed them on, and here you are doing
      them again. Maybe one day you\u2019ll show them to someone else."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19950775983067143
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19950775983067144
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19950775983067145
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19950775983067146
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19950775983067147
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19950775983067148
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19950775983067149
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19950775983067150
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19950775983067151
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19950775983067152
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19950775983067153
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19950775983067154
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19950775983067155
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19950775983067156
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19950828537696256
    m_Localized: What are these pedestals for?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19950828537696257
    m_Localized: "I\u2019ve seen travellers leave fruit on them before. I always
      wondered why\u2026 There are two pedestals. Want to try putting a fruit on
      each?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19950828537696258
    m_Localized: "Now you know how to do it. It\u2019s lovely when you think about
      it\u2026 Someone learned these gestures, passed them on, and here you are doing
      them again. Maybe one day you\u2019ll show them to someone else."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19950828537696259
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19950828537696260
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19950828537696261
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19950828537696262
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19950828537696263
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19950870682062848
    m_Localized: "To help this area, we\u2019d need to relight all the lanterns\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19950870682062849
    m_Localized: "This one\u2019s broken\u2026 How else could we light it?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19950870682062850
    m_Localized: Remember our new companion ?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19950870682062851
    m_Localized: It works! Thank you, little firefly.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19950870682062852
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19950870682062853
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19950870682062854
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19950870682062855
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19950870682062856
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19950870682062857
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19950870682062858
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19951376229912576
    m_Localized: 'Fruit for the Phytos!

      Fed up with the Jemytos!

      What
      have the Ytorales ever done for us?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19951376229912577
    m_Localized: "The J\xE9mytos? The Ytorales? Who are they?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19951376229912578
    m_Localized: The Phytos and the Ytorales come from the same people. They used
      to live together. Now they talk to each other less and less.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19951376229912579
    m_Localized: "And the J\xE9mytos?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19951376229912580
    m_Localized: "They\u2019re little creatures that come out of the Portal of Renewal.
      When a J\xE9myto eats a fruit, it becomes a little Phyto or a little Ytorale."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19951376229912581
    m_Localized: "So they\u2019re the future inhabitants of both villages?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19951376229912582
    m_Localized: Yes. And the portal runs on the wood the Ytorales burn in their
      incinerator.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19951376229912583
    m_Localized: "But then\u2026 why are they arguing?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19951376229912584
    m_Localized: "Let\u2019s listen to them."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19951376229912585
    m_Localized: "The J\xE9mytos have been eating all our fruit ever since they showed
      up! If this goes on, what will we have left? Let\u2019s all go to the Ytorale
      village together. They have to listen to us!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19951376229912586
    m_Localized: We need our fruit too!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19951376229912587
    m_Localized: "Wait\u2026 Your harvests are at risk, I understand why you\u2019re
      angry. But do we know why all the J\xE9mytos come here?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19951376229912588
    m_Localized: "Because there\u2019s fruit! And the Ytorales let them. We\u2019ve
      already talked to them, but nothing has changed."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19951376229912589
    m_Localized: "A meeting? Maybe\u2026 But what guarantees they\u2019ll listen
      to us this time?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19951376229912590
    m_Localized: "I can\u2019t promise that. But if you listen to them too, it can
      help. You could show them your harvests and ask what they suggest."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19951376229912591
    m_Localized: "Yes\u2026 And I\u2019d really like to understand why all the J\xE9mytos
      end up here."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19951376229912592
    m_Localized: "Someone could go and meet them, and look at the route the J\xE9mytos
      take."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19951376229912593
    m_Localized: "You think something\u2019s going on with them ?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19951376229912594
    m_Localized: "Maybe. We don\u2019t know yet. Let\u2019s go and see, and ask them."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19951376229912595
    m_Localized: "That\u2019s true\u2026 We see the J\xE9mytos arrive, but we don\u2019t
      know what happens before."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19951376229912596
    m_Localized: "I still want the Ytorales to hear us. But we might as well know
      what\u2019s going on before we all go."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19951376229912597
    m_Localized: "Tom, would you go and see? Find out where the J\xE9mytos come from
      and ask the Ytorales what\u2019s happening on their side."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19951376229912598
    m_Localized: "Okay. I\u2019ll tell you what I see and hear."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19951376229912599
    m_Localized: "Meanwhile, let\u2019s head back to the fields. They need to understand
      what these harvests mean to us."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19951376229912600
    m_Localized: "You listened to what was worrying them. Now they also want to understand
      what\u2019s happening on the other side."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19951376229912601
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19951376229912602
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19951376229912603
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19951376229912604
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19951376229912605
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19951376229912606
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19951376229912607
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19951376229912608
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19951376229912609
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19951376229912610
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19951376229912611
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19951376229912612
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19951376229912613
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19951376229912614
    m_Localized: What if we set up a meeting to show them the damage and look for
      a solution together?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19951376229912615
    m_Localized: "We could follow the J\xE9mytos\u2019 route to understand what brings
      them this way."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19951376229912616
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19951376229912617
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19951376229912618
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19951376229912619
    m_Localized: "We could follow the J\xE9mytos\u2019 route to understand what brings
      them this way."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19951376229912620
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19951376229912621
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19951376229912622
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19951376229912623
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19951376229912624
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19951376229912625
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19951376229912626
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19951376229912627
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19951376229912628
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19951442604773376
    m_Localized: The trees need to stay protected and have enough room.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19951442604773377
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19951442604773378
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19951442604773379
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19951488561762304
    m_Localized: "My name\u2019s Camille\u2026 Look at my hand. It\u2019s gone all
      grey. I don\u2019t understand what\u2019s happening to me."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19951488561762305
    m_Localized: Do you want us to look at it together?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19951488561762306
    m_Localized: "Yes\u2026 I\u2019d like that."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19951488561762307
    m_Localized: Light brought the colours back near the lanterns. We could try it
      here too. Is that okay with you?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19951488561762308
    m_Localized: Okay.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19951488561762309
    m_Localized: "Look\u2026 the colour\u2019s coming back! I thought it was gone
      forever. Thank you!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19951488561762310
    m_Localized: "It was still there\u2026 You helped him find it again."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19951488561762311
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19951488561762312
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19951488561762313
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19951488561762314
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19951488561762315
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19951488561762316
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19951488561762317
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19951488561762318
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19951550436134912
    m_Localized: "Hey! I\u2019m stuck on the balcony\u2026 I don\u2019t dare move."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19951550436134913
    m_Localized: "I\u2019m here. Take your time. If you want, we can take a breather
      for a moment."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19951550436134914
    m_Localized: "Yes\u2026 I\u2019d like that."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19951550436134915
    m_Localized: I can make a path. Tell me if the platforms are close enough for
      you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19951550436134916
    m_Localized: I made it! Thanks for staying with me. It really helped.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19951550436134917
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19951550436134918
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19951550436134919
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19951550436134920
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19951550436134921
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19951550436134922
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19951594203697152
    m_Localized: "My fruit fell down the well\u2026 I tripped over this pot. And
      I scraped my leg!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19951594203697153
    m_Localized: It should end up at the bottom of the well too!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19951594203697154
    m_Localized: "Yes! I\u2019d finally found a nice ripe fruit\u2026 and now it\u2019s
      down there!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19951594203697155
    m_Localized: It mattered to you. What could help you right now?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19951594203697156
    m_Localized: "My leg stings a bit\u2026 but it\u2019s mostly the fruit. It took
      me so long to find it!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19951594203697157
    m_Localized: We can look for something to do about that.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19951594203697158
    m_Localized: "In the moment, it\u2019d feel great! But\u2026 it wouldn\u2019t
      bring my fruit back."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19951594203697159
    m_Localized: So what could help you?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19951594203697160
    m_Localized: "Getting my fruit back\u2026 But it\u2019s too far down."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19951594203697161
    m_Localized: What if we looked for another one?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19951594203697162
    m_Localized: "I\u2019d love that\u2026 but the J\xE9mytos eat almost everything.
      We\u2019d have to find one before they do."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19951594203697163
    m_Localized: Do you know where I could look?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19951594203697164
    m_Localized: "In the forest! That\u2019s where I found this one!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19951594203697165
    m_Localized: "I\u2019ll go and look."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19951594203697166
    m_Localized: "You found one! It looks really ripe. Thanks again! I'm going to
      really savor it\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19951594203697167
    m_Localized: But very far from this well.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19951594203697168
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19951594203697169
    m_Localized: You look really angry.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19951594203697170
    m_Localized: 'What bothers you most: your leg or the lost fruit?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19951594203697171
    m_Localized: Do you think smashing the pot would fix anything?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19951594203697172
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19951594203697173
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19951594203697174
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19951594203697175
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19951594203697176
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19951594203697177
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19951594203697178
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19951594203697179
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19951594203697180
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19951594203697181
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19951594203697182
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19951594203697183
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19951594203697184
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19951594203697185
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19951594203697186
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19951594203697187
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19951676152008704
    m_Localized: "I\u2019m Malik. I look after this tree\u2026 but it hasn\u2019t
      given any fruit for a while."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19951676156203008
    m_Localized: "Do you know what\u2019s changed?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19951676156203009
    m_Localized: "No\u2026 I keep looking after it, but nothing grows. I don\u2019t
      know what else to try."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19951676156203010
    m_Localized: Do you want us to look together at what it might be missing?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19951676156203011
    m_Localized: "Yes, I\u2019d like that."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19951676156203012
    m_Localized: I water it every day. Look, the soil is still damp.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19951676156203013
    m_Localized: "Okay. Let\u2019s look at the other leads."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19951676156203014
    m_Localized: "You can feel the breeze here too. I don\u2019t think that\u2019s
      it."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19951676156203015
    m_Localized: "Let\u2019s look for what\u2019s different for this tree."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19951676156203016
    m_Localized: "Now that you mention it\u2026 the trees around it have grown. It\u2019s
      almost always in the shade."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19951676156203017
    m_Localized: We could try lighting it up and see how it reacts.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19951676156203018
    m_Localized: "Let\u2019s try!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19951676156203019
    m_Localized: "Look, fruit! So it was light it was missing\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19951676156203020
    m_Localized: "Thanks for looking with me. I\u2019ll build it a lantern so it
      stays lit."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19951676156203021
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19951676156203022
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19951676156203023
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19951676156203024
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19951676156203025
    m_Localized: Does it get enough water?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19951676156203026
    m_Localized: Does it get enough light?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19951676156203027
    m_Localized: Does the air flow well over here?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19951676156203028
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19951676156203029
    m_Localized: Does it get enough light?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19951676156203030
    m_Localized: Does the air flow well over here?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19951676156203031
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19951676156203032
    m_Localized: Does it get enough water?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19951676156203033
    m_Localized: Does it get enough light?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19951676156203034
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19951676156203035
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19951676156203036
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19951676156203037
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19951676156203038
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19951676156203039
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19951716786425856
    m_Localized: "Not again! Another tool\u2019s gone. I bet it\u2019s that fox that\u2019s
      always hanging around here!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19951716786425857
    m_Localized: Did you see it take anything?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19951716786425858
    m_Localized: "No\u2026 but I spotted it near the shed."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19951716786425859
    m_Localized: That gives us a lead. We could see where it goes and look for the
      planks.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19951716786425860
    m_Localized: "Yes\u2026 And if it really is the fox, I\u2019d like to understand
      what it does with them."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19951716786425861
    m_Localized: "Jos\xE9 saw it near the shed. Shall we start there?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19951716786425862
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19951716786425863
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19951716786425864
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19951716786425865
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19951716786425866
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19951716786425867
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19951716786425868
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19951716786425869
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19951759710932992
    m_Localized: "The planks  are here\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19951759710932993
    m_Localized: "Look at what it\u2019s doing with them."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19951759710932994
    m_Localized: "It didn\u2019t want to steal from Jos\xE9. It needed somewhere
      to shelter\u2026 and this is all it found."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19951759710932995
    m_Localized: "And Jos\xE9 needs his planks."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19951759710932996
    m_Localized: "We need to find something that works for both of them. I\u2019ll
      tell him what we saw."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19951759710932997
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19951759710932998
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19951759710932999
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19951759710933000
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19951759710933001
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19951759710933002
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19951759710933003
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19951819672702976
    m_Localized: I found the tools near the fox. It was trying to use them to make
      itself a shelter.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19951819672702977
    m_Localized: "A shelter? I hadn\u2019t thought of that\u2026 But we need those
      planks to work."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19951819672702978
    m_Localized: Could we make it a spot here and get the planks back?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19951819672702979
    m_Localized: Would there be room for a little hut near the shed?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19951819672702980
    m_Localized: "That should be possible, I\u2019ll talk to the others."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19951819672702981
    m_Localized: "It seems to like it. And we\u2019ve got our planks back."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19951819672702982
    m_Localized: "By going to look, you discovered something we hadn\u2019t understood."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19951819672702983
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19951819672702984
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19951819672702985
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19951819672702986
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19951819672702987
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19951819672702988
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19951819672702989
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19951819672702990
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19951819672702991
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19951854674169856
    m_Localized: The people of the snowy region need seeds to plant. Could you give
      them some?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19951854674169857
    m_Localized: "We\u2019d like to\u2026 but look: this part of the forest is losing
      its colours. We can\u2019t harvest seeds here any more."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19951854674169858
    m_Localized: What have you tried?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19951854674169859
    m_Localized: "A few things, with no result. I don\u2019t know what to do any
      more."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19951854674169860
    m_Localized: "Light has helped us before. I\u2019ll give it a try."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19951854674169861
    m_Localized: Can I do something with you?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19951854674169862
    m_Localized: "What if you shared your light with In\xE8s?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19951854674169863
    m_Localized: I can pass this power on to you. Shall we try together?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19951854674169864
    m_Localized: Yes!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19951854674169865
    m_Localized: Look, the colours are coming back!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19951854674169866
    m_Localized: Here, these are for the people of the snowy region. We can finally
      send them some.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19951854674169867
    m_Localized: "Thank you! I\u2019ll take them to them."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19951854674169868
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19951854674169869
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19951854674169870
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19951854674169871
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19951854674169872
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19951854674169873
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19951854674169874
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19951854674169875
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19951854674169876
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19951854674169877
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19951854674169878
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19951854674169879
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19951854674169880
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19951854674169881
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19951854674169882
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19951854674169883
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19951854674169884
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19951854674169885
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19952136388792320
    m_Localized: "Look\u2026 both lines are going to the same forest."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19952136388792321
    m_Localized: "To the Phytos\u2019 trees\u2026 No wonder they\u2019re running
      out of fruit."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19952136388792322
    m_Localized: The path to the Ytorale forest is closed. What if we reopened it?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19952136388792323
    m_Localized: "It works! They won\u2019t all eat in the same place any more."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19952136388792324
    m_Localized: There. Sometimes all it takes is opening another path for everyone
      to find their way.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19952136388792325
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19952136388792326
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19952136388792327
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19952136388792328
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19952136388792329
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19952136388792330
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19952136388792331
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19952136388792332
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19952169054031872
    m_Localized: "I\u2019m missing five flowers for my collection\u2026 I\u2019ve
      been searching for a while, but I can\u2019t find a single one. What\u2019s
      the point of carrying on?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19952169054031873
    m_Localized: "Hey, don\u2019t give up now! Do you want to show me the ones you\u2019re
      missing? I could look out for them while I explore."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19952169054031874
    m_Localized: "You\u2019d do that for me? I can describe them to you. Maybe you\u2019ll
      spot one I missed."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19952169054031875
    m_Localized: "Hey\u2026 this one looks like one of Adrien\u2019s flowers."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19952169054031876
    m_Localized: "The last one! I\u2019ll go and show them to Adrien."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19952169054031877
    m_Localized: "You found them\u2026 all five! I was starting to think there weren\u2019t
      any left."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19952169054031878
    m_Localized: I found them while exploring the forest and the lakeside.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19952169054031879
    m_Localized: Thanks for looking. It makes me want to go exploring again too.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19952169054031880
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19952169054031881
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19952169054031882
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19952169054031883
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19952169054031884
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19952169054031885
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19952169054031886
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19952169054031887
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19952169054031888
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19952169054031889
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19952169054031890
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19952169054031891
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19952701210546178
    m_Localized: See the plant near the mushroom? What would happen if you made it
      grow?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19952701210546185
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19952701210546186
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19953188580282368
    m_Localized: "The incinerator\u2019s overheating! The water isn\u2019t reaching
      the well to cool it down!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19953188580282369
    m_Localized: "We\u2019ll look at it together. Can you show me where the water
      used to flow?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19953188580282370
    m_Localized: "That way\u2026 It came from the river, all the way to the well."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19953188580282371
    m_Localized: "The water\u2019s coming back\u2026 It\u2019s cooling down!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19953188580282372
    m_Localized: You showed us where to look.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19953188580282373
    m_Localized: I was scared everything would give out. Following the water helped
      me see where to start.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19953188580282374
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19953188580282375
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19953188580282376
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19953188580282377
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19953188580282378
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19953188580282379
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19953188580282380
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19953219345502208
    m_Localized: "The incinerator\u2019s almost out of wood! If it stops, the Portal
      of Renewal could go out!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19953219349696512
    m_Localized: Can you see any wood we could use?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19953219349696513
    m_Localized: "Over there! But it\u2019s too heavy\u2026 I\u2019ll never drag
      it here in time."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19953219349696514
    m_Localized: I can try to bring it closer with my power. Can you get the incinerator
      ready meanwhile?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19953219349696515
    m_Localized: "Yes, I\u2019m on it!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19953219349696516
    m_Localized: "It\u2019s starting up again! All I could see was that log I couldn\u2019t
      move\u2026 With two of us, we managed in time."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19953219349696517
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19953219349696518
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19953219349696519
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19953219349696520
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19953219349696521
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19953219349696522
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19953219349696523
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19953244628766720
    m_Localized: "The dull zone has reached the incinerator\u2026 We can\u2019t use
      it any more. And look: one of the lanterns is broken."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19953244628766721
    m_Localized: "I\u2019ve come across a lantern like that before. I\u2019m going
      to try something."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19953244628766722
    m_Localized: "The colours are coming back! A firefly\u2026 I\u2019d never have
      thought of that. Thank you both."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19953244628766723
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19953244628766724
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19953244628766725
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19953244628766726
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19953244628766727
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19953244628766728
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19953275146522624
    m_Localized: "The water keeps pooling around the incinerator\u2026 Whose idea
      was it to build it in a hollow like this?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19953275146522625
    m_Localized: "We need to get the water level down. Let\u2019s see what we can
      use around us."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19953275146522626
    m_Localized: "Look, it\u2019s soaking up the water! The level\u2019s dropping."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19953275146522627
    m_Localized: "I was only looking at the water\u2026 I hadn\u2019t even noticed
      that plant. Thanks!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19953275146522628
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19953275146522629
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19953275146522630
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19953275146522631
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19953275146522632
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19953275146522633
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19953275146522634
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19953302975729664
    m_Localized: "What\u2019s bothering you?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19953302975729665
    m_Localized: "I need to get to the incinerator island. You can get there by bouncing
      on that big plant\u2026 but I\u2019m scared of heights."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19953302975729666
    m_Localized: We can look for another way. Would you feel better in the water?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19953302975729667
    m_Localized: "Yes\u2026 if I could swim."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19953302975729668
    m_Localized: I can share my swimming power with you. Want to try?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19953302975729669
    m_Localized: "Yes. I\u2019ll start slowly."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19953302975729670
    m_Localized: "I did it! I felt stuck with that plant\u2026 I hadn\u2019t thought
      of going another way. Thanks!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19953302975729671
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19953302975729672
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19953302975729673
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19953302975729674
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19953302975729675
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19953302975729676
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19953302975729677
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19953302975729678
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19953333627703296
    m_Localized: Are you looking for something?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19953333627703297
    m_Localized: A way to dry up the river.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19953333627703298
    m_Localized: Sorry?! But why?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19953333627703299
    m_Localized: Since the water came back, our lumberjack robots have been stuck
      on the other side. No way to bring the wood back.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19953333627703300
    m_Localized: "Do we need to get rid of all the water\u2026 or find them a way
      across?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19953333627703301
    m_Localized: A way across would do. They just need to cross without going into
      the water.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19953333627703302
    m_Localized: "They\u2019re heavy. They\u2019d need something solid under their
      feet."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19953333627703303
    m_Localized: "They\u2019re getting across! I was so focused on the water that
      I didn\u2019t think of going over it. Thanks! I can get back to moving the
      wood."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19953333627703304
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19953333627703305
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19953333627703306
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19953333627703307
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19953333627703308
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19953333627703309
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19953333627703310
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19953333627703311
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19953333627703312
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19953333627703313
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19953333627703314
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19953333627703315
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19953358097272832
    m_Localized: "Hey there! I fell in here looking for wood\u2026 I spend my days
      fixing paths, and now I\u2019m the one who\u2019s stuck!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19953358097272833
    m_Localized: I can make platforms. Tell me if you can reach the next one.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19953358097272834
    m_Localized: Ah, it feels good to be back on the path! Thanks for the hand.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19953358097272835
    m_Localized: "You said you fix paths? There\u2019s a broken bridge a bit further
      on. Could you come and take a look?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19953358097272836
    m_Localized: Of course! Show me. My turn to give you a hand.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19953358097272837
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19953358097272838
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19953358097272839
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19953358097272840
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19953358097272841
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19953358097272842
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19953358097272843
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19953386350104576
    m_Localized: "Hi\u2026 I\u2019m Lily. And this is George."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19953386350104577
    m_Localized: "He\u2019s eating less and moving around much less than before.
      I don\u2019t understand what\u2019s going on."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19953386350104578
    m_Localized: Have you noticed anything change around him?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19953386350104579
    m_Localized: "I don\u2019t know\u2026 I thought he had everything he needed."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19953386350104580
    m_Localized: "You look sad, George\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19953386350104581
    m_Localized: "But why? What\u2019s he missing?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19953386350104582
    m_Localized: "We don\u2019t know yet. We can watch what he\u2019s drawn to and
      what he avoids."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19953386350104583
    m_Localized: "Look around him too. What suits us doesn\u2019t necessarily suit
      him."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19953386350104584
    m_Localized: "Okay\u2026 We\u2019ll figure it out with you."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19953386350104585
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19953386350104586
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19953386350104587
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19953386350104588
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19953386350104589
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19953386350104590
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19953386350104591
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19953386350104592
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19953386350104593
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19953386350104594
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19953437822603264
    m_Localized: "He probably needs a place that suits him better\u2026 We could
      look for somewhere with water. But which one would suit him?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19953437822603265
    m_Localized: "Let\u2019s try suggesting a few ideas to him."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19953437822603266
    m_Localized: "He doesn\u2019t seem interested\u2026 Let\u2019s try another idea."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19953437822603267
    m_Localized: "He\u2019s pulling back\u2026 Maybe the current wouldn\u2019t suit
      him. Let\u2019s find something else."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19953437822603268
    m_Localized: "Oh, he\u2019s reacting! He might like that."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19953437822603269
    m_Localized: We could look for a spot by the lake and see how he feels there.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19953437822603270
    m_Localized: "Yes, let\u2019s go and look with him."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19953437822603271
    m_Localized: I can help you find a spot and gather what you need to set it up.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19953437822603272
    m_Localized: "Reeds, water lilies\u2026 We could start with those, then see how
      George settles in."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19953437822603273
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19953437822603274
    m_Localized: Maybe a well?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19953437822603275
    m_Localized: What about a lake, with calm water?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19953437822603276
    m_Localized: Maybe a river?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19953437822603277
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19953437822603278
    m_Localized: What about a lake, with calm water?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19953437822603279
    m_Localized: Maybe a river?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19953437822603280
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19953437822603281
    m_Localized: Maybe a well?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19953437822603282
    m_Localized: What about a lake, with calm water?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19953437822603283
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19953437822603284
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19953437822603285
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19953437822603286
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19953437822603287
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19953437822603288
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19953483716677632
    m_Localized: "Your J\xE9mytos are eating our fruit, and now we\u2019re starting
      to run out! Are you going to do something about it?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19953483716677633
    m_Localized: And we keep the incinerator running for everyone! Do you know how
      much work that takes? It feels like nobody sees it. And what do we get? Complaints!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19953483716677634
    m_Localized: "Wait\u2026 Tom, you\u2019re talking about the harvests. Harry,
      you\u2019re talking about the work at the incinerator. Can we listen to you
      one at a time?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19953483716677635
    m_Localized: This has been going on for too long! The Ytorales only see their
      own needs!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19953483716677636
    m_Localized: "And you only ever see what we don\u2019t do. Never everything we
      already do!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19953483716677637
    m_Localized: "Right now, I can\u2019t listen to both of them. I\u2019ll try to
      understand what\u2019s going on for each of them. We\u2019ll pick it up again
      when they can listen to each other."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19953483716677638
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19953483716677639
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19953483716677640
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19953483716677641
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19953483716677642
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19953483716677643
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19953483716677644
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19953514796470272
    m_Localized: Your emotional sensitivity could help. Take a moment to watch each
      of them.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19953514796470273
    m_Localized: What do you notice?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19953514796470274
    m_Localized: You can take a bit longer. Or ask them directly.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19953514796470275
    m_Localized: "Let\u2019s listen to them separately. They\u2019ll be able to tell
      you what matters most to them."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19953514796470276
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19953514796470277
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19953514796470278
    m_Localized: "Tom seems really frustrated. He keeps coming back to the fruit
      they\u2019re missing."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19953514796470279
    m_Localized: Harry keeps stressing all the work they do. Maybe he feels nobody
      notices it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19953514796470280
    m_Localized: "I can see they\u2019re angry\u2026 but I don\u2019t know what\u2019s
      behind it."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19953514796470281
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19953514796470282
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19953514796470283
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19953562817056768
    m_Localized: "Tom\u2026 earlier, you looked frustrated. Is that right?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19953562817056769
    m_Localized: "Yes, that\u2019s it!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19953562817056770
    m_Localized: What bothers you most about this situation?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19953562817056771
    m_Localized: "The J\xE9mytos are eating our fruit and we\u2019re starting to
      run short. I feel like the Ytorales don\u2019t see what it costs us."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19953562817056772
    m_Localized: Do you want to explain?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19953562817056773
    m_Localized: "We work hard for those harvests. And when we ask for help, they
      talk to us about the incinerator. When it comes to fruit, we\u2019re on our
      own."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19953562817056774
    m_Localized: "I mostly talked with Harry\u2026 well, we argued. I haven\u2019t
      seen how they organise things yet."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19953562817056775
    m_Localized: "So you know what\u2019s happening to your harvests. But there are
      still things to understand on their side."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19953562817056776
    m_Localized: "Yes\u2026 I was a bit quick to say they weren\u2019t making any
      effort."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19953562817056777
    m_Localized: "That we have enough fruit left. And that we work out together how
      to feed the J\xE9mytos, instead of leaving the Phytos to manage alone."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19953562817056778
    m_Localized: "You\u2019d like both villages to take care of it together?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19953562817056779
    m_Localized: Exactly.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19953562817056780
    m_Localized: "Maybe\u2026 I\u2019m still annoyed, but yes. It would be better
      to know before accusing them."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19953562817056781
    m_Localized: "I\u2019ll also listen to Harry and look at how the J\xE9mytos move
      around. Then we can compare what we\u2019ve learned."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19953562817056782
    m_Localized: "Okay. I\u2019m still angry\u2026 but I\u2019d like to understand
      how we got here."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19953562817056783
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19953562817056784
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19953562817056785
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19953562817056786
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19953562817056787
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19953562817056788
    m_Localized: "Since you got here, what have you been able to see? What do you
      really know about what\u2019s happening on their side?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19953562817056789
    m_Localized: And for you, if one thing could change, what would it be?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19953562817056790
    m_Localized: "Then maybe we should go and see what\u2019s really happening on
      their side before deciding they\u2019re making no effort."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19953562817056791
    m_Localized: "I\u2019ll also listen to Harry and look at how the J\xE9mytos move
      around. Then we can compare what we\u2019ve learned."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19953562817056792
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19953562817056793
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19953562817056794
    m_Localized: "Since you got here, what have you been able to see? What do you
      really know about what\u2019s happening on their side?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19953562817056795
    m_Localized: And for you, if one thing could change, what would it be?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19953562817056796
    m_Localized: "Then maybe we should go and see what\u2019s really happening on
      their side before deciding they\u2019re making no effort."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19953562817056797
    m_Localized: "I\u2019ll also listen to Harry and look at how the J\xE9mytos move
      around. Then we can compare what we\u2019ve learned."
    m_Metadata:
