    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19953562821251073
    m_Localized: "Since you got here, what have you been able to see? What do you
      really know about what\u2019s happening on their side?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19953562821251074
    m_Localized: And for you, if one thing could change, what would it be?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19953562821251075
    m_Localized: "Then maybe we should go and see what\u2019s really happening on
      their side before deciding they\u2019re making no effort."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19953562821251076
    m_Localized: "I\u2019ll also listen to Harry and look at how the J\xE9mytos move
      around. Then we can compare what we\u2019ve learned."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19953562821251077
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19953562821251078
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19953562821251079
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19953562821251080
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19953703292686336
    m_Localized: "Harry, I\u2019d like to understand what\u2019s going on on your
      side. Do you want to tell me about it?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19953703292686337
    m_Localized: "We keep the incinerator running for everyone. Without it, the Portal
      of Renewal wouldn\u2019t work. But I feel like nobody sees that work, and all
      anyone sees is what we do wrong."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19953703292686338
    m_Localized: "All the work it takes. The wood to bring in, the water to keep
      an eye on\u2026 It doesn\u2019t run by itself."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19953703292686339
    m_Localized: And what would you need for things to go better?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19953703292686340
    m_Localized: "For us to look together at how to share the work. And for people
      to ask what we can do before saying we\u2019re making no effort."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19953703292686341
    m_Localized: "No. Tom says they\u2019re starting to run short of fruit. I haven\u2019t
      been to look."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19953703292686342
    m_Localized: You could ask him to show you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19953703292686343
    m_Localized: "Yes\u2026 Earlier, I was mostly busy defending our work. I didn\u2019t
      ask him many questions."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19953703292686344
    m_Localized: "Yes, come on. I\u2019ll show you."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19953703292686345
    m_Localized: You helped us earlier. You saw what it takes to keep them running.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19953703292686346
    m_Localized: "That\u2019s what keeps the Portal of Renewal running."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19953703292686347
    m_Localized: "Yes. I\u2019d like to understand what\u2019s going on with their
      fruit\u2026 and be able to explain our work to him without us interrupting
      each other."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19953703292686348
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19953703292686349
    m_Localized: What would you like the Phytos to understand?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19953703292686350
    m_Localized: "And the Phytos\u2019 harvests, have you seen what\u2019s happening
      to them?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19953703292686351
    m_Localized: Can you show me how the incinerator powers the portal?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19953703292686352
    m_Localized: Would you be okay with picking up the conversation with Tom again?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19953703292686353
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19953703292686354
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
