      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19953703292686374
    m_Localized: "And the Phytos\u2019 harvests, have you seen what\u2019s happening
      to them?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19953703292686375
    m_Localized: Can you show me how the incinerator powers the portal?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19953703292686376
    m_Localized: Would you be okay with picking up the conversation with Tom again?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19953703292686377
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19953703292686378
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19953740760403968
    m_Localized: Do you want to pick up the conversation again? What would you like
      to ask each other so things go better?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19953740760403969
    m_Localized: "I understand better why the incinerator matters to everyone. On
      our side, we\u2019re really starting to run out of fruit. Can we work out together
      how to feed the J\xE9mytos while keeping enough fruit for ourselves?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19953740760403970
    m_Localized: "Yes. We could start by looking at what\u2019s left on your trees
      and where the J\xE9mytos come in."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19953740760403971
    m_Localized: One of the lines now goes to the Ytorale forest. We can check whether
      that leaves you enough fruit.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19953740760403972
    m_Localized: We could follow their route. It might give us a lead.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19953740760403973
    m_Localized: "On our side, the incinerator takes a lot of work. Would you come
      and see? I\u2019d like us to look at whether some tasks could be shared."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19953740760403974
    m_Localized: "Yes. We\u2019ll need to keep enough time for the harvests too."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19953740760403975
    m_Localized: Okay. We can talk about it with the others and see what everyone
      can do.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19953740760403976
    m_Localized: Where do you want to start?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19953740760403977
    m_Localized: With the harvests? I can show you the trees that are worst hit.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19953740760403978
    m_Localized: "Let\u2019s go. Then I\u2019ll show you the incinerator."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19953740760403979
    m_Localized: "They still have things to sort out\u2026 but now they\u2019ve agreed
      on a first step together."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19953740760403980
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19953740760403981
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19953740760403982
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19953740760403983
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19953740760403984
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19953740760403985
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19953740760403986
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19953740760403987
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19953740760403988
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19953740760403989
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19953740760403990
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19953740760403991
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19953740760403992
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19953740760403993
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19953740760403994
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19953770380578816
    m_Localized: "You look all alone\u2026 Are you looking for someone?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19953770380578817
    m_Localized: I can stay with you for a bit, if you want.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19953770380578818
    m_Localized: "Watch it. It can\u2019t talk, but its reactions already give clues
      about what it\u2019s feeling. See what catches its attention\u2026 That could
      help us understand."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19953770380578819
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19953770380578820
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19953770380578821
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19953770380578822
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19953770380578823
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19953770380578824
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19953798293671936
    m_Localized: Want to take a look? You can settle in if you like.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19953798293671937
    m_Localized: "Looks like it likes it. I\u2019ll keep an eye on its little spot."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19953798293671938
    m_Localized: "I\u2019ll come back and see you."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19953798293671939
    m_Localized: "A place of your own, someone who thinks of you\u2026 that can help
      you feel less alone."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19953798293671940
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19953798293671941
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19953798293671942
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19953798293671943
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19953798293671944
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19953798293671945
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19953819672039424
    m_Localized: "Hey! I\u2019m under here! Everyone backs away when I try to move\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19953819672039425
    m_Localized: Is it you making the leaves move?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19953819672039426
    m_Localized: "Yes! I can\u2019t get out. Can you help me?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19953819672039427
    m_Localized: "I\u2019ll try to move them aside. Gently\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19953819672039428
    m_Localized: "Ah\u2026 thank you! I can finally breathe. From a distance, I must
      have looked a bit strange\u2026 but all it took was coming closer."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19953819672039429
    m_Localized: From a distance, all we could see was a ball of leaves moving.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19953819672039430
    m_Localized: And from inside, all I could see was leaves!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19953819672039431
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19953819672039432
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19953819672039433
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19953819672039434
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19953819672039435
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19953819672039436
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19953819672039437
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19953819672039438
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19953839859224576
    m_Localized: Some people in the volcano region need wood to build. Could you
      give them some?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19953839859224577
    m_Localized: "We\u2019d like to\u2026 but the forest is starting to go dull,
      and so are our wood stores. We\u2019ve tried everything, but nothing works\u2026
      As long as our stores are dull, we won\u2019t have any wood to give you."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19953839859224578
    m_Localized: "With In\xE8s, we managed to revive an area by lighting it up together.
      Want to try?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19953839859224579
    m_Localized: Yes. How can I help?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19953839859224580
    m_Localized: "I can share my power with you. Then we\u2019ll light up the same
      area."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19953839859224581
    m_Localized: Look! The colours are coming back on the logs!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19953839859224582
    m_Localized: "We can use this wood again. Thank you! I\u2019ll get some ready
      for the people of the volcano."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19953839859224583
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19953839859224584
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19953839859224585
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19953839859224586
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19953839859224587
    m_Localized: 
